        "raw": "<p>Sorry, while I did actually cosplay as Unity on Saturday at Essen, the only picture I have of me is completely washed out and blurry. Never did manage to meet up with any other cosplayers either. However, I was approached by about 30 fairly random people during my four days at Essen Spiel who asked me &#39;where our booth was&#39;.</p><p>I wasn&#39;t even wearing a Sentinels T-Shirt!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
